2
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,750
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,040
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,360
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,170
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:11,020
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 20=

12
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:21,859
Song Ziyuan,

13
00:01:22,699 --> 00:01:23,540
did you see that?

14
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:24,300
She...

15
00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:25,219
She's...

16
00:01:26,219 --> 00:01:26,820
Li,

17
00:01:27,419 --> 00:01:28,300
I saw it.

18
00:01:29,059 --> 00:01:30,100
It's the Grand Shaman.

19
00:01:31,619 --> 00:01:32,699
She's my mother.

20
00:01:33,940 --> 00:01:34,979
And that's my father.

21
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,979
I've never seen my father before.

22
00:01:39,139 --> 00:01:39,740
Tell me,

23
00:01:40,259 --> 00:01:41,219
is this real?

24
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:42,580
Li,

25
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:44,139
calm down first.

26
00:01:45,259 --> 00:01:46,419
We need to figure out

27
00:01:47,139 --> 00:01:48,259
what this place is

28
00:01:48,779 --> 00:01:50,059
and how we got here.

29
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:52,219
Right.

30
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:54,699
We were clearly in Jinan City.

31
00:01:55,979 --> 00:01:57,900
We watched my mother lose her mind.

32
00:01:59,380 --> 00:02:00,820
Why didn't we die?

33
00:02:01,820 --> 00:02:03,380
Instead, we've gone back twenty years?

34
00:02:07,779 --> 00:02:08,460
Li,

35
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:11,420
are you sure this is the real world?

36
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:16,980
Does it hurt?

37
00:02:17,339 --> 00:02:18,059
Yes, it hurts.

38
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:19,700
If it hurts, it's real.

39
00:02:28,539 --> 00:02:29,219
Something's off.

40
00:02:29,740 --> 00:02:31,300
How come my shamanic powers are gone?

41
00:02:35,099 --> 00:02:35,700
Li,

42
00:02:36,020 --> 00:02:37,059
think carefully.

43
00:02:37,619 --> 00:02:38,740
Where would something

44
00:02:38,819 --> 00:02:40,020
like this happen?

45
00:02:42,020 --> 00:02:43,580
It feels like the real world,

46
00:02:44,659 --> 00:02:46,460
yet I've lost my shamanic powers.

47
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:48,819
Unless...

48
00:02:49,819 --> 00:02:51,180
We're inside my mother's memories.

49
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:05,539
Even Chu Li can't save you?

50
00:03:06,140 --> 00:03:06,980
Grand Shaman,

51
00:03:07,539 --> 00:03:08,779
what am I supposed to do?

52
00:03:11,619 --> 00:03:12,499
Food's ready.

53
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:13,900
Come eat!

54
00:03:14,099 --> 00:03:14,980
Time to eat!

55
00:03:15,980 --> 00:03:16,860
Come on, take a seat.

56
00:03:17,059 --> 00:03:18,219
- Take a seat.
- Careful, dear.

57
00:03:19,819 --> 00:03:21,939
Have some food
to get your strength back.

58
00:03:23,819 --> 00:03:24,379
Oh, right.

59
00:03:24,539 --> 00:03:26,300
I still don't know your names.

60
00:03:27,819 --> 00:03:29,059
Just call me Li.

61
00:03:29,740 --> 00:03:30,700
Li?

62
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:32,860
What a lovely name.

63
00:03:36,779 --> 00:03:37,700
Song Ziyuan.

64
00:03:38,059 --> 00:03:39,099
Ziyuan?

65
00:03:39,539 --> 00:03:40,140
By the way,

66
00:03:40,499 --> 00:03:41,700
where are you two headed?

67
00:03:41,819 --> 00:03:43,580
How did you end up unconscious
at the entrance to our village?

68
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:46,180
We...

69
00:03:46,819 --> 00:03:48,779
My wife and I were traveling

70
00:03:49,379 --> 00:03:50,300
and lost our way.

71
00:03:50,499 --> 00:03:51,779
Thank goodness we met you, Chu.

72
00:03:52,379 --> 00:03:53,339
I see.

73
00:03:53,779 --> 00:03:54,379
By the way,

74
00:03:54,619 --> 00:03:56,180
if you're not in a hurry,

75
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:58,339
you're welcome to stay
in Lingshan Village a few more days.

76
00:03:58,740 --> 00:03:59,980
Rest up before you go.

77
00:04:01,819 --> 00:04:02,700
That sounds good.

78
00:04:03,020 --> 00:04:04,460
Thanks for letting us stay, Chu.

79
00:04:04,779 --> 00:04:05,580
You're welcome.

80
00:04:07,059 --> 00:04:07,700
Eat up.

81
00:04:08,059 --> 00:04:08,779
Don't be shy.

82
00:04:09,819 --> 00:04:10,659
Chu,

83
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:13,099
aren't you afraid

84
00:04:14,219 --> 00:04:15,339
that we might be bad people?

85
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:20,299
There aren't that many bad people
in the world.

86
00:04:20,739 --> 00:04:21,500
Besides,

87
00:04:22,179 --> 00:04:23,299
as you can see,

88
00:04:23,620 --> 00:04:25,179
we don't have much money.

89
00:04:25,339 --> 00:04:26,140
So

90
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:28,460
there's nothing here worth stealing.

91
00:04:33,260 --> 00:04:34,140
Li,

92
00:04:34,299 --> 00:04:36,099
you keep staring at my face.

93
00:04:36,419 --> 00:04:38,500
Is there something on my face?

94
00:04:39,219 --> 00:04:39,979
Let me see.

95
00:04:42,539 --> 00:04:43,179
No.

96
00:04:44,060 --> 00:04:45,140
It's just that...

97
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:47,580
You look a bit like my mother.

98
00:04:48,179 --> 00:04:48,979
Me?

99
00:04:50,140 --> 00:04:50,940
No wonder.

100
00:04:51,179 --> 00:04:52,739
That's why she called me Mother

101
00:04:52,739 --> 00:04:53,779
the first time she saw me.

102
00:04:55,339 --> 00:04:56,339
In that case,

103
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:58,380
the two of us are truly fated to meet.

104
00:04:59,339 --> 00:05:01,219
If my baby turns out to be

105
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:03,739
as pretty and sweet as you,

106
00:05:03,940 --> 00:05:05,380
I'd be so happy.

107
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:09,659
(Your very existence is a mistake.)

108
00:05:13,739 --> 00:05:15,779
Do you love your child very much?

109
00:05:17,500 --> 00:05:18,659
Of course.

110
00:05:19,779 --> 00:05:22,179
What mother doesn't love her own child?

111
00:05:31,739 --> 00:05:32,460
Take your time.

112
00:05:46,539 --> 00:05:47,539
Why are you crying?

113
00:05:47,979 --> 00:05:48,739
Li,

114
00:05:49,060 --> 00:05:49,700
what's wrong?

115
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:55,580
I just miss my mother.

116
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:02,099
Li, you miss your mother so much.

117
00:06:02,779 --> 00:06:05,419
She must have been very good to you.

118
00:06:09,339 --> 00:06:10,380
I'm a bit tired.

119
00:06:11,179 --> 00:06:12,419
I'll go rest first.

120
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:17,940
Won't you have some more?

121
00:06:19,779 --> 00:06:21,219
You barely ate anything.

122
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:25,500
Eat up.

123
00:06:26,099 --> 00:06:27,979
Did I say something wrong just now?

124
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:30,219
No.

125
00:06:30,539 --> 00:06:31,979
Isn't that how we always chat?

126
00:06:32,580 --> 00:06:34,140
It's fine. Don't overthink it.

127
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:37,500
Here, eat up.

128
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:53,580
Ever since I was little,

129
00:06:54,460 --> 00:06:56,299
I can hardly remember
her ever smiling at me.

130
00:06:57,900 --> 00:06:58,940
Then what was all that about?

131
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:01,219
Do you know anything about her past?

132
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:04,140
As far back as I can remember,

133
00:07:04,779 --> 00:07:06,179
I was already in the Shaman Clan.

134
00:07:07,380 --> 00:07:09,580
Mother put me with the other children

135
00:07:10,339 --> 00:07:11,820
and never gave me any special care.

136
00:07:13,779 --> 00:07:15,979
The former Grand Shaman Jining
let it slip,

137
00:07:16,779 --> 00:07:17,739
and that's how I learned

138
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:19,859
she was actually my mother.

139
00:07:21,099 --> 00:07:22,739
Later, after I kept pressing her,

140
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:24,380
she told me

141
00:07:25,620 --> 00:07:26,380
my father

142
00:07:27,419 --> 00:07:29,099
had passed away before I was born.

143
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:32,460
It seems

144
00:07:32,940 --> 00:07:34,099
everything that happened

145
00:07:34,380 --> 00:07:35,739
may be linked to your father.

146
00:07:37,779 --> 00:07:39,219
So what do we do now?

147
00:07:41,099 --> 00:07:42,299
I don't know

148
00:07:43,099 --> 00:07:44,299
why this memory

149
00:07:44,460 --> 00:07:46,099
became the Grand Shaman's inner demon,

150
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:47,700
but

151
00:07:48,179 --> 00:07:49,580
at least we have a chance

152
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:51,380
to learn the truth
of what happened back then.

153
00:07:55,099 --> 00:07:55,739
No.

154
00:07:55,979 --> 00:07:57,299
We need to leave here quickly.

155
00:07:57,779 --> 00:07:59,380
The fall of Jinan City is approaching.

156
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:03,940
But how do we get out?

157
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:10,580
We need to find a way

158
00:08:10,900 --> 00:08:11,779
to wake her up.

159
00:08:12,339 --> 00:08:13,179
Once she wakes,

160
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:14,219
perhaps

161
00:08:14,859 --> 00:08:15,900
we can get out.

162
00:08:19,219 --> 00:08:19,979
Li,

163
00:08:20,900 --> 00:08:22,339
you were lying to me before,
weren't you?

164
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:24,620
Lying about what?

165
00:08:25,859 --> 00:08:27,700
You said you'd leave Jinan City,

166
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:29,060
but you drugged me,

167
00:08:29,419 --> 00:08:30,659
swapped our souls,

168
00:08:30,739 --> 00:08:31,779
and sent me away.

169
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:34,380
From beginning to end,

170
00:08:34,539 --> 00:08:36,380
you never intended to leave Jinan City.

171
00:08:38,939 --> 00:08:39,699
Isn't that right?

172
00:08:50,659 --> 00:08:51,659
Then do you think

173
00:08:52,340 --> 00:08:53,340
I'd have let you stay

174
00:08:53,579 --> 00:08:54,659
while I left alone?

175
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:57,179
You wouldn't leave.

176
00:08:58,179 --> 00:08:59,100
Neither would I.

177
00:09:02,260 --> 00:09:03,100
Well,

178
00:09:04,620 --> 00:09:05,500
looks like we're dying together.

179
00:09:18,699 --> 00:09:19,380
By the way,

180
00:09:20,699 --> 00:09:21,699
after you sent me away,

181
00:09:22,299 --> 00:09:24,779
why did you have Steward Sun
chase after us?

182
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:27,419
After I sent you off,

183
00:09:28,539 --> 00:09:29,860
I went to the palace to find Lanruo.

184
00:09:36,620 --> 00:09:37,900
So I suspect

185
00:09:38,860 --> 00:09:40,140
Lanruo and Fusheng

186
00:09:41,059 --> 00:09:42,380
might be connected somehow.

187
00:09:44,980 --> 00:09:45,900
All along the way,

188
00:09:46,380 --> 00:09:48,459
Fusheng seemed off to me,

189
00:09:49,140 --> 00:09:50,699
but I couldn't put my finger on it.

190
00:09:51,579 --> 00:09:52,380
Fortunately,

191
00:09:52,539 --> 00:09:53,860
I already killed Lanruo.

192
00:09:55,179 --> 00:09:57,500
Fusheng is just an ordinary person

193
00:09:57,980 --> 00:09:59,179
with no shamanic powers.

194
00:09:59,860 --> 00:10:01,299
He shouldn't be able to do anything.

195
00:10:02,419 --> 00:10:03,740
But Lanruo...

196
00:10:04,140 --> 00:10:05,740
She said you failed again and again.

197
00:10:06,380 --> 00:10:07,380
What did she mean by that?

198
00:10:09,939 --> 00:10:11,100
She's a lunatic.

199
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:12,100
Don't listen to a word

200
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:12,980
she says.

201
00:10:14,539 --> 00:10:16,500
Actually, I've had a lot of questions
all along.

202
00:10:17,260 --> 00:10:19,179
But you always brush them aside.

203
00:10:23,100 --> 00:10:24,340
None of that matters.

204
00:10:24,900 --> 00:10:25,860
Just remember this:

205
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:27,020
I love you,

206
00:10:27,900 --> 00:10:29,299
and you have to stay alive.

207
00:10:29,900 --> 00:10:30,779
That's enough.

208
00:10:31,579 --> 00:10:32,459
Song Ziyuan,

209
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:35,059
you say I lied to you,

210
00:10:35,819 --> 00:10:37,220
but you lied to me too.

211
00:10:37,939 --> 00:10:38,860
Lanruo said

212
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:40,860
you and my mother
went to see her together.

213
00:10:41,179 --> 00:10:42,980
What are you two hiding from me?

214
00:10:44,939 --> 00:10:45,699
Do you know

215
00:10:45,939 --> 00:10:47,740
what Grand Shaman Yaohua's power is?

216
00:10:53,819 --> 00:10:54,779
I only know

217
00:10:55,740 --> 00:10:58,179
my mother is the most powerful shaman
in the Shaman Clan.

218
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:02,340
Your mother's ability

219
00:11:03,459 --> 00:11:04,380
is foresight.

220
00:11:05,579 --> 00:11:07,299
She can see things before they happen.

221
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:10,380
That's how she knew
Jinan City would be in danger.

222
00:11:11,860 --> 00:11:14,380
That's why she wanted to join forces
with me to deal with Lanruo

223
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:16,980
and trick you into leaving Jinan City.

224
00:11:19,579 --> 00:11:20,819
So my mother...

225
00:11:22,779 --> 00:11:24,419
It wasn't because she hated me.

226
00:11:27,179 --> 00:11:28,699
She wanted to protect me.

227
00:11:32,299 --> 00:11:33,699
I misjudged her.

228
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:54,059
Yaohua?

229
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:57,179
Li, you're awake.

230
00:11:57,579 --> 00:11:58,380
What's wrong?

231
00:12:00,459 --> 00:12:02,779
Yan went to deliver medicine today.

232
00:12:03,059 --> 00:12:03,699
I...

233
00:12:05,459 --> 00:12:06,340
Yaohua,

234
00:12:07,459 --> 00:12:08,220
what do you want to say?

235
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:09,140
You can tell me.

236
00:12:09,900 --> 00:12:10,699
Perhaps

237
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:12,179
I can help you.

238
00:12:15,419 --> 00:12:17,100
Every time I close my eyes,

239
00:12:17,579 --> 00:12:19,179
I see Yan...

240
00:12:21,020 --> 00:12:22,100
He's dead.

241
00:12:22,900 --> 00:12:23,620
What?

242
00:12:25,459 --> 00:12:26,860
Just forget it. I'm talking nonsense.

243
00:12:27,179 --> 00:12:28,059
I believe you.

244
00:12:31,939 --> 00:12:32,980
You believe me?

245
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:37,740
Actually,

246
00:12:38,299 --> 00:12:40,340
I've been able to see visions
since I was little.

247
00:12:41,059 --> 00:12:43,179
Mostly things that haven't happened yet.

248
00:12:44,779 --> 00:12:46,459
But no one believed me.

249
00:12:47,220 --> 00:12:48,779
They all called me a jinx,

250
00:12:49,220 --> 00:12:50,459
a monster.

251
00:12:51,659 --> 00:12:53,380
So I stopped talking about it.

252
00:12:54,179 --> 00:12:55,860
But this time it's about Yan.

253
00:12:57,620 --> 00:12:58,699
I'm so scared.

254
00:12:59,939 --> 00:13:00,620
Yaohua!

255
00:13:01,299 --> 00:13:02,059
I'm back!

256
00:13:03,860 --> 00:13:05,299
Seems I was overthinking it.

257
00:13:06,699 --> 00:13:07,340
How was it?

258
00:13:07,579 --> 00:13:08,380
You must be exhausted.

259
00:13:08,740 --> 00:13:09,500
- Let me handle it.
- It's fine.

260
00:13:10,179 --> 00:13:10,620
Come on.

261
00:13:10,659 --> 00:13:11,779
I'll handle it.

262
00:13:15,459 --> 00:13:16,380
Look at you.

263
00:13:16,819 --> 00:13:17,340
It's fine.

264
00:13:17,419 --> 00:13:19,380
Let's go make them some food.

265
00:13:19,500 --> 00:13:20,539
Come on. Let's go.

266
00:13:20,699 --> 00:13:22,299
We'll go prepare a meal for you.

267
00:13:24,059 --> 00:13:24,740
Careful.

268
00:13:25,900 --> 00:13:26,699
If only

269
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:30,459
we could change all of this.

270
00:13:31,699 --> 00:13:32,819
How wonderful that would be.

271
00:13:34,980 --> 00:13:36,020
It's already happened.

272
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:37,539
We can't change it.

273
00:13:39,740 --> 00:13:40,980
But now you have a chance

274
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:42,179
to spend more time with them.

275
00:14:11,299 --> 00:14:12,020
Li,

276
00:14:12,579 --> 00:14:14,860
if only you could stay with me like this
forever.

277
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:22,140
After I give birth,

278
00:14:22,539 --> 00:14:24,059
I'll bring the child to see you.

279
00:14:24,539 --> 00:14:25,299
Would you like that?

280
00:14:26,980 --> 00:14:27,779
Sure.

281
00:14:33,059 --> 00:14:33,900
Alright now.

282
00:14:34,140 --> 00:14:35,299
Go get some sleep.

283
00:14:35,699 --> 00:14:36,539
Tomorrow,

284
00:14:36,699 --> 00:14:38,100
come with me to town.

285
00:14:38,500 --> 00:14:39,539
I want to buy some cloth

286
00:14:39,659 --> 00:14:40,900
to make shoes for the baby.

287
00:14:41,699 --> 00:14:42,380
Okay.

288
00:14:57,819 --> 00:14:58,659
What's wrong?

289
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:01,539
It's nothing.

290
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:03,100
I just...

291
00:15:04,299 --> 00:15:05,500
I really miss my mother.

292
00:15:09,579 --> 00:15:11,860
Children always miss their mothers.

293
00:15:12,299 --> 00:15:13,939
If you want to see her,

294
00:15:14,579 --> 00:15:15,579
then go see her.

295
00:15:19,340 --> 00:15:20,059
Alright.

296
00:15:24,699 --> 00:15:25,699
Look at you,

297
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:27,340
such a crybaby.

298
00:15:27,900 --> 00:15:29,260
If a girl cries too much,

299
00:15:29,340 --> 00:15:30,380
she'll grow ugly.

300
00:15:32,260 --> 00:15:33,059
Go to sleep.

301
00:15:33,620 --> 00:15:35,579
If you can't get up on time tomorrow,
I'll be upset.

302
00:15:36,340 --> 00:15:37,020
Alright.

303
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:38,539
I'll go rest.

304
00:15:46,500 --> 00:15:47,500
This girl

305
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:48,980
has so much on her mind.

306
00:15:57,443 --> 00:16:04,193
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

307
00:16:04,603 --> 00:16:11,273
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

308
00:16:11,643 --> 00:16:14,963
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

309
00:16:15,133 --> 00:16:18,333
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

310
00:16:18,663 --> 00:16:25,323
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

311
00:16:25,743 --> 00:16:32,403
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

312
00:16:32,693 --> 00:16:39,053
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

313
00:16:39,223 --> 00:16:42,653
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

314
00:16:42,913 --> 00:16:46,133
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

315
00:16:46,173 --> 00:16:53,053
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

316
00:16:53,403 --> 00:16:56,933
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

317
00:16:57,093 --> 00:17:00,653
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

318
00:17:01,053 --> 00:17:07,493
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

319
00:17:36,403 --> 00:17:43,073
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

320
00:17:43,323 --> 00:17:49,613
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
